      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "二砲隊　卒族を以て編制す"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Two artillery companies, organised from the sotsu class. This column stands to the right of the ○明石藩 marker, so it belongs to the preceding domain: it continues Akita Domain's military list, which on the facing leaf ends with ten artillery companies raised from the shizoku class."
