      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Acting senior councillor (gon-dai-sanji): 2 persons. Two names, Hashimoto Naka and Saitō Morie, stand in this same column in the lower register. A third name, Kawamura Kuranushi, stands in the next column to the left, which carries no label of its own. On every other Fascicle 9 leaf I checked, a label-less name column continues the office named to its right, which would make Kawamura a third holder of this post against the printed figure of 2. The page prints no editorial correction, so the conflict is left open."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "明石権大参事"
